Sr. No.	Command Name	Git Command
1	Check Git Version	:git --version
2	Clone Repository	:git clone https://github.com/softengg/SE-Lab.git
3	Open Repository	:cd SE-Lab
4	Create Homepage File :	touch index.html
5	Check Repository Status:	git status
6	Add Homepage File:	git add index.html
7	Commit Homepage:	git commit -m "Added homepage"
8	Push to Main Branch:	git push origin main
9	Create Feature Branch:	git checkout -b feature-login
10	Create Login File:	touch login.html
11	Add All Files:	git add .
12	Commit Login Page:	git commit -m "Added login page"
13	Push Feature Branch:	git push origin feature-login
14	Switch to Main Branch:	git checkout main
15	Pull Latest Changes:	git pull origin main
16	Delete Local Branch:	git branch -d feature-login
17	Delete Remote Branch:	git push origin --delete feature-login
18	View Commit History:	git log
